WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.420
Each step up the five types of AI agents raises cost and blast radius by roughly an order of magnitude.

2
00:00:07.467 --> 00:00:10.827
That's because each step decides more without a human,

3
00:00:10.827 --> 00:00:14.187
so a reactive chatbot can only give a bad answer,

4
00:00:14.187 --> 00:00:18.067
but an autonomous agent can act on it ten times.

5
00:00:18.067 --> 00:00:20.907
The steps run from reactive and tool-using agents,

6
00:00:20.907 --> 00:00:23.527
through loop agents and multi-agent systems,

7
00:00:23.527 --> 00:00:25.500
to persistent-goal agents.

8
00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:26.580
So to pick one,

9
00:00:26.580 --> 00:00:28.620
I ask if it takes actions,

10
00:00:28.620 --> 00:00:30.620
keeps state across interactions,

11
00:00:30.620 --> 00:00:32.300
or needs several agents.

12
00:00:32.300 --> 00:00:33.800
If it's only text,

13
00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:36.260
the first two steps probably suffice,

14
00:00:36.260 --> 00:00:38.180
and each yes adds cost.
